<title>USA: Universal signs 2-yr deal with ITV Network.</title>
<headline>Universal signs 2-yr deal with ITV Network.</headline>
<dateline>UNIVERSAL CITY 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Universal Inc's Universal International Television unit Wednesday said it reached an agremeent with the United Kingdom's  ITV Network with films, TV movies, series and library product.</p>
<p>The two-year deal covers theatrical releases for 1996-97. The film slate included in the volume deal includes &quot;Dante's Peak&quot;, &quot;The Nutty Professor&quot; and &quot;Liar, Liar&quot;.</p>
<p>Universal Inc is a unit of Seagram Co Ltd.</p>
</text>
